#: ../../../web_visualization.md:1
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../web_visualization.md:3
msgid ""
"Web visualization supports rendering and interacting with running Gazebo "
"simulations. You may find web visualization useful when interacting with "
"remote or headless Gazebo Sim simulations. No additionally dependencies, "
"other than a browser and internet connection, are required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../web_visualization.md:9
msgid ""
"Instructions for setting up a websocket server and gzweb visualization can "
"be found in the [gz-sim websocket server tutorial](https://gazebosim.org/api/"
"sim/10/websocket_server.html)."
msgstr ""
